select 'Food Truck Association of the Philippines', 'association', 'PH', 'Metro Manila', null, null, '{}'::text[], 'en', 'Asia/Manila', 'partners-3-lists-2026-11-16', 'not_now', 'medium', 'unverified', 'It launched in Dec 2012 at the Cucina Andare market and has been dormant since about 2013. I found no Facebook page or any later evidence. Inactive: newest evidence 2013-12-08 (https://philstar.com/lifestyle/sunday-life/2013/12/08/1265362/movable-feasts) — nothing since 2024.', 'https://philstar.com/lifestyle/sunday-life/2013/12/08/1265362/movable-feasts', now(), false, 'email', null, null, null, '2013-12-08'::date, 'Started with 3-4 trucks (Philstar, Dec 2013)'
