select 'Truckers DXB', 'collective', 'AE', 'Dubai', 'https://truckers.ae', null, '{}'::text[], 'en', 'Asia/Dubai', 'partners-3-lists-2026-11-16', 'not_now', 'medium', 'unverified', 'The newest evidence is a Truckers UAE fair at Emirates Golf Club on 26 Oct 2019 (article dated 14 Oct 2019). The Instagram handle comes from a 2017 post link; whether the account is still current is unverified. Inactive: newest evidence 2019-10-14 (https://thenationalnews.com/lifestyle/food/a-huge-food-truck-festival-is-coming-to-dubai-s-emirates-golf-club-1.923324) — nothing since 2024.', 'https://www.instagram.com/truckersdxb/', now(), false, 'instagram', null, 'https://www.instagram.com/truckersdxb/', null, '2019-10-14'::date, '~60 trucks across Dubai and Abu Dhabi for Season 3 (late 2017, eyeofriyadh.com); 15 trucks at the 2017 Summer Warehouse'
